    KiciaUI  -  standalone Roblox (Luau) UI library
    Design language (theme tokens, metrics, rail + page + section layout, toggle / ripple look)
    taken from the original script's UI. No game features are included.

    Quick start:
        local UI = loadstring(readfile("KiciaUI.lua"))()
        local Window  = UI:CreateWindow({ Title = "KICIA" })
        local Page    = Window:AddPage({ Name = "Main", Description = "Core options" })
        local Section = Page:AddSection({ Name = "General" })
        Section:AddToggle({ Label = "Enabled", Flag = "Enabled", Default = true, Callback = print })
        Window:AddSettingsPage()

    See Example.lua for every component.
]]

